              "value": "(disease); DC 18 Fortitude; Stage 1: carrier with no effect (1d6 hours); Stage 2: victim's hair falls out (1d6 hours); Stage 3: victim's ears grow into leathery wings, tentacles sprout on the chin and scalp, and the teeth become long, pointed fangs (1 day); Stage 4: victim's mind regresses to a vicious and unintelligent shell of its former self (1d6 hours); Stage 5: victim's head breaks free of the body (which dies)"
